    {
      "id": "359ee7ba-90ed-45bc-b317-03347c45ffec",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "String name = \"My name is John Wick and i worked in a movie called John Wick 4\";\r\n\r\n//this is to count the characters\r\n// Method: length()\r\n// What:   returns the number of characters, spaces included (a method, so it needs brackets)\r\n// Use:    to validate input length, or as the limit of a loop over the characters\r\nint length = name.length(); // 63 characters\r\nSystem.out.print(\"Length of the string: \" + length);",
